   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Safety and operating rules\n- Go-live cutoff prevents historical tests from being actioned.\n- Score **≤ 60%** starts a 7-day rest: cold daily limit becomes 1 and warmup stays enabled.\n- A later test **> 60%** after the due date restores the previous daily limit.\n- A failed retest queues replacement for human approval; it never charges a card.\n- Set Domains → **Mailbox Source** to `Direct Panel` where applicable. Direct-panel failures and listed domains recommend domain replacement.\n- Phase 1 uses daily limit 1. Replace this with campaign detachment only after the exact Email Bison endpoint is verified.",
    "height": 360,
    "width": 500,
